		<p>The lamp turns on automatically when the sun visor vanity mirror cover is opened.</p>
		<note type="caution">
			<p>Always close the sun visor vanity mirror cover to turn the lamp <term translate="no">OFF</term> when not in use. If the sun visor is closed while the lamp remains on, it may cause 12V battery discharge or damage the sun visor.</p>
		</note>
